&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex technical concepts into business outcomes for executives and decision-makers (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong workshop and facilitation skills to align technical and business stakeholders (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and oral communication skills in English (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable engaging with a wide range of personnel, from technical to executive positions (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience identifying solution gaps, ability to propose innovations, and execute subsequent implementation strategies (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active participation in the Apple enterprise community including conferences, forums, user groups, thought leadership content, or public speaking (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
